{
  "id": "aref_carlyrics",
  "title": "Car Lyrics",
  "description": "Synced lyrics (LRCLIB) for whatever the car is playing: Apple Music over CarPlay, Bluetooth or USB, no Spotify needed. It reads the track from the head unit itself. Experimental: version 0.1 is also a probe, because the field that carries the CarPlay track on iDrive 7 isn't known yet; its Probe screen shows what the car reports. Read-only toward the car. Needs internet through the Store's uplink.",
